// WP-8 / HIGH-03: single source of truth for the Tauri app command list.
//
// `include!`d by `build.rs` (AppManifest -> autogenerated `allow-<cmd>` permissions, so every
// command needs an explicit capability grant) and compiled into the lib as
// `app_commands::APP_COMMANDS`. build.rs fails the build unless it matches `generate_handler!`, the
// `#[tauri::command]` functions in `commands.rs` and the permission sets in `permissions/`.
// Plain `//` comments only: this file is `include!`d at item level.

